        "environment": "权威侧Freezable与grassgekko/SGgrassgekko；冻结组件状态和SG状态分别核验。",
        "excluded": "不覆盖玩家温度低温、所有boss/自定义SG、native渲染同步或现实时间推进。"
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "EXP-FREEZE-001-C01",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "组件初态NORMAL、coldness=0、resistance=1、wearofftime=10、damagetobreak=0；构造监听attacked并加freezable标签。IsFrozen同时包含FROZEN和THAWING，IsThawing只匹配THAWING。attacked处理在冻结且实体有效时累计abs(data.damage)，达到阈值Unfreeze；默认阈值0故零伤害事件也可满足条件。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "FF-S01",
            "FF-S02"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-FREEZE-001-C02",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "AddColdness先调用redirectfn(inst,coldness,freezetime,nofreeze)，真值即整个返回；否则coldness钳至至少0。只有传入coldness>0才更新冻结状态：已冻则重调Freeze；未达有效抗性启动衰减；达到抗性时仅在sg存在且(nofreeze或sg有nofreeze标签)才抑制Freeze并钳到抗性。因此nofreeze参数并非无SG对象的统一禁冻开关，负寒冷不会自行解冻。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "FF-S02",
            "FF-S03",
            "FF-S04"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-FREEZE-001-C03",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "Freeze只在entity可见且非health死亡时执行；onfreezefn先于state写入，随后设FROZEN、重排wearoff任务、更新色调、StopBrain(\"frozen\")、清combat目标并停locomotor；仅状态改变才发freeze并在diminishingreturns开启时增加额外抗性。Freeze不自行设置coldness为抗性，不检查nofreeze；重冻同FROZEN不再发freeze。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "FF-S04"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-FREEZE-001-C04",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "WearOff按FROZEN→Thaw、THAWING→Unfreeze、NORMAL且coldness>0→每次减1再视情况续排。Thaw保留IsFrozen为真，清coldness并发onthaw；其传入StartWearingOff的时间已经ResolveWearOffTime，而StartWearingOff内部再做一次同变换。Unfreeze清状态/寒冷/伤害累计，生成碎冰FX并更新色调；仅非死亡时RestartBrain(\"frozen\")、发unfreeze并BlankOutAttacks(.3)。Unfreeze/Reset未主动取消wearofftask；Reset只设NORMAL/coldness=0并更新色调，不发事件、不恢复Brain、不清damagetotal。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "FF-S01",
            "FF-S02",
            "FF-S03",
            "FF-S04"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-FREEZE-001-C05",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "CommonHandlers.OnFreeze要求health存在且未死，OnFreezeEx允许无health对象；两者都跳转frozen。CommonStates的frozen监听unfreeze/onthaw，thaw监听unfreeze；进态后复查组件当前状态以处理同帧排队事件。frozen退出仅在not statemem.thawing时清swap_frozen；onthaw先将statemem.thawing设true再进thaw，因此该转换保留symbol。thaw退出停止thawing声音并无条件清swap_frozen。grassgekko在master分界后装burnable/freezable及SG，其SG登记OnFreeze和AddFrozenStates。组件本身不添加实体frozen标签；不能把SG标签、实体标签和IsFrozen当同一查询。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "FF-S05",
            "FF-S06",
            "FF-S07",
            "FF-S08",
            "FF-S09",
            "FF-S01",
            "FF-S04"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-FREEZE-001-C06",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "Freezable:OnSave只在extraresist>0时返回向下取一位小数的extraresist，OnLoad只通过SetExtraResist恢复它；没有保存coldness/state/wearoff剩余时长。EntityScript收集组件OnSave的非空表，再调用prefab OnSave；加载对组件调用OnLoad后再调用prefab OnLoad，故本卡不排除其他prefab自定义恢复。OnRemoveFromEntity解绑attacked、去freezable标签并取消两类任务，但不调用Unfreeze/Reset、不清色调也不RestartBrain；RemoveComponent先移除组件索引再调该hook。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "FF-S01",
            "FF-S04",
            "FF-S21",
            "FF-S22",
            "FF-S23"
          ]
        },
        {
